    "KFaceDistanceMatrix[facetsLst_List, k_Integer] Given a simplicial \
complex as a list of facets facetsLst and dimensionality k, it computes the \
k-face distance matrix between every pair of faces of cardinality facedim, \
where each path steps on only (k+1)-dimensional faces. It uses the built in \
Mathematica GraphDistanceMatrix function on a graph constructed such that the \
vertices are all clqdim-faces and edges between them are 1 if two faces are \
contained in a bigger clique and 0 otherwise.", "synonyms" -> {}, 
    "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> "KFaceDistanceMatrix", "titlemodifier" -> 
